MAIN
MOVE TEMP 14 4
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 ChainTest_ved_TestChain
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 19
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 20
PRINT TEMP 4
END
ChainTest_ved_TestChain [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 21 4
MOVE TEMP 22 HALLOCATE TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 4
MOVE TEMP 24 HALLOCATE TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 Builder_ved_GetWorker
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
MOVE TEMP 27 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 1 )
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 28 15
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 28
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 29 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 2 TEMP 9 )
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 12
PRINT TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 30 0
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 30

RETURN TEMP 13
END
Builder_ved_GetWorker [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 31 4
MOVE TEMP 32 HALLOCATE TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 4
MOVE TEMP 34 HALLOCATE TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 TEMP 3
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 36 Worker_ved_DoWork
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 2

RETURN TEMP 1
END
Worker_ved_DoWork [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 37 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 37
MOVE TEMP 38 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 38

RETURN TEMP 3
END

